<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh Aug gold output 900 kg, unchanged mth/mth.</title>
<headline>Kazakh Aug gold output 900 kg, unchanged mth/mth.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kazakh gold output in August was 0.9 tonnes, unchanged on July, the State Statistics Committee said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The committee released the following figures:</p>
<p>			KAZAKH GOLD, SILVER OUTPUT</p>
<p>			    Aug    July   Jan-Aug 1996  Jan-Aug 1995</p>
<p> Gold (kg)		900    900	 7,100	    n/a</p>
<p>  Mth/mth pct change    0    -11.3	 n/a	    n/a</p>
<p>  Yr/yr pct change	0     -0.7	  -1.0	  +10.0</p>
<p> Silver (tonnes)	 33.8   30	   n/a	    n/a</p>
<p>  Mth/mth pct change  +12.6  -22.5	 n/a	    n/a</p>
<p>  Yr/yr pct change     -1.7    5.5	  +7.3	   -6.0</p>
<p>--Almaty newsroom +7 327 2 509410</p>
</text>
